<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; AI NOTE: PROVISIONAL machine alignment produced by Codex from the spine's exact GMR English, using an English-first review. Repeated fruit and growth forms were resolved from complete offset lists. Distributed negation and the uncertain leisure-place recast remain unwrapped rather than being falsely nulled.</div>
